{
 "about": "Every place the old game shows a symbol the port draws as an icon (GM1-7), as Chromium 152 computes it there in the light theme and under html.dark-mode: the font (CSS shorthand), the colour, the ground behind it (colours composited up the tree, a gradient taken at its first stop) and the opacity; and the advance and ink box (left, right, ascent, descent from the pen position on the baseline, in em) Chromium's canvas measured for the symbol in that font. Made by Tools/Scripts/make-icon-sheet.sh --uses from the old game (Tools/IconSheet/old-game-uses.js); the icon sheet shows each use.",
